# {{projectName}}

A cross-platform app built with [Tauri 2](https://tauri.app) — React +
Ant Design frontend, Rust backend — targeting desktop (macOS, Windows, Linux)
and mobile (iOS, Android) from the same codebase. Scaffolded with
[dude](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude) (`tauri` stack).

## Quick start

```bash
export GITHUB_TOKEN=<token with read:packages>   # @cubocicloide registry auth
pnpm install
dude doctor   # verify Rust + platform prerequisites
dude dev      # run the desktop app with hot-reload
```

## Everyday commands

| Command              | What it does                                                     |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `dude dev`           | Run the desktop app in development mode (Vite + Rust hot-reload).|
| `dude build`         | Build the distributable installers (`src-tauri/target/…`).       |
| `dude android init`  | One-time Android setup (Rust targets + native project).          |
| `dude android dev`   | Run on an Android emulator/device (`--host` for real devices).   |
| `dude android build` | Build the APK/AAB.                                               |
| `dude ios init`      | One-time iOS setup (macOS only).                                 |
| `dude ios dev`       | Run on an iOS simulator/device.                                  |
| `dude ios build`     | Build the IPA.                                                   |
| `dude lint`          | Structural checks — FE (React) + BE (Rust/Tauri) conventions.    |
| `dude format`        | prettier (frontend) + cargo fmt (backend).                       |
| `dude review`        | lint + ESLint + tsc + cargo fmt --check + cargo clippy.          |
| `dude test`          | cargo test (unit tests live next to each command module).        |
| `dude docs`          | Serve the project docs (MkDocs) at http://localhost:8001.        |
| `dude icon`          | Regenerate the app icon set from `app-icon.png`.                 |
| `dude help`          | Live catalog of every available command.                         |

## Where things live

- `src/` — React frontend (pages, components, hooks, typed IPC in `src/ipc/`).
- `src-tauri/` — Rust backend (commands, state, errors, Tauri config).
- `.claude/rules/` — the conventions `dude lint` enforces, explained.
- `docs/` — project documentation (`dude docs` to preview).

Read `CLAUDE.md` for the full development guide.
